{"kind": "mod", "id": 1562, "name": "SPT - Variable Construction Time", "slug": "spt-variable-construction-time", "teaser": "This mod allows you to adjust the construction speed of your hideout buildings.", "owner_name": "Hooshu", "downloads": 6075, "favourites": 0, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": "MIT License", "guid": null, "thumbnail_local": null, "category": null, "category_id": null, "updated_at": "2026-07-07T16:58:58.000000Z", "created_at": "2024-07-14T14:16:53.000000Z", "published_at": "2024-07-14T14:16:53.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~3.10.0", "latest_version": "1.1.2", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": "https://choosealicense.com/licenses/mit/", "description_html": "<p>By default, the mod reduces construction time to 10% of the normal duration. You can customize this setting in the config.json file.</p>\n<p>Additionally, you can set a multiplier for each building individually, which will override the global multiplier.</p>\n<p>Multiplier values in the config file are in percentages. For example, to make buildings construct 50% slower, set the multiplier to 150.</p>\n<p><strong>Please ensure the multiplier is set to a positive value. Setting it too high may cause unintended issues in the game. Use at your own risk.</strong></p>\n", "versions": [{"version": "1.1.1", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.10.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 189, "published_at": "2024-12-22T15:01:53.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1562/spt-variable-construction-time/1.1.1", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.1.2", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.10.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 3087, "published_at": "2024-12-22T15:09:43.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1562/spt-variable-construction-time/1.1.2", "github_url